{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1793773042028880829,"compiled_state":{"alias":"abdicative-barathea-zorilla","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":0,"unsigned":2},"authorship_ledger":[],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1793754096639944001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"9dad1a06-55e8-44bf-be57-f1e228e8e56f","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"007c-dabe-21a5-4e92"}],"description":"/opt/rebar/.deployed_ref on rebar-gerrit (i-00880b2c7f13527c5) reads \"d4a0a2a44 (feat/gerrit-ci-verified-gate)\", mtime 2026-07-02 18:17 UTC. That commit is NOT an ancestor of origin/main.\n\nWho reads it: only infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh:560-567, the first-run seed path, and only when /var/lib/rebar/deployed-sha is empty. Today deployed-sha holds c6f116f1ae8 (= origin/main, written 2026-11-04 00:48 UTC), so nothing reads the marker in steady state.\n\nWhy it still matters: the host mirror /var/lib/rebar/mirror DOES resolve d4a0a2a44^{commit} (checked read-only 2026-11-03). So if deployed-sha is ever lost (state wipe, re-provision of /var/lib/rebar), autodeploy adopts a July feature-branch commit as \"deployed\" instead of the current tip, and the next tick computes its change sets from d4a0a2a44..main. The file is also excluded from the rsync (autodeploy.sh:101), so nothing refreshes it, and an operator reading it sees a four-month-old, off-main ref as the deployed state.\n\nUnverified: what a d4a0a2a44..main diff would trigger on that first tick (which paths classes it would mark changed).\n\nAcceptance: either autodeploy stops seeding from .deployed_ref (and the stale file is removed by the deploy), or autodeploy keeps it current on each successful deploy; a test under tests/ pins the chosen behavior on an empty deployed-sha.\n\nFound 2026-11-03 while gathering evidence for alchemic-ornate-eider (session a85e3cd3).","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":4,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["ops-sweep"],"ticket_id":"b5b8-0194-c1eb-49ba","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Stale /opt/rebar/.deployed_ref would seed autodeploy off-main","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["f65d25f9-9934-4488-afd6-e2cd2f260f63","9dad1a06-55e8-44bf-be57-f1e228e8e56f"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1793773042028880829,"uuid":"590e5429-6878-4c5c-a83e-32f8f52fdb1a"}